hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"212","Astawdi'u Allāha dīnaka wa amānātaka, wa khawātima 'amalik.. I entrust to Allah your faith, your trustworthiness, and the outcomes of your deeds."
"213","Zawwadaka Allahu at-Taqwa, wa ghafara dhanbaka, wa yassara laka al-khayra haythumta kunta.. May Allah grant you piety, forgive your sins, and make goodness easy for you wherever you may be."
